# Pest Control Quest
# Given by the Guard NPC

quest pest_control
name Pest Control
npc guard

# Sequential objectives - player must turn in each item in order
objective chitin
objective bones

# Rewards given on completion
reward_gil 50
reward_quest_points 1

# Dialogue when quest is not started (intro)
dialogue_start
Halt, adventurer. I have a task for you.
The area has been plagued by dangerous creatures lately.
Scorpions lurk to the east, and trolls roam the northern hills.
Slay one of each and bring me proof - their chitin and bones.
I'll pay you 50 gold for your trouble.
.

# Dialogue when on stage 1 (need chitin) and player doesn't have it
dialogue_stage_1
Have you killed a scorpion yet?
Bring me its chitin as proof. They're to the east.
.

# Dialogue when on stage 1 and player HAS chitin
dialogue_turnin_1
Excellent work! You've proven yourself against the scorpion.
I'll take that chitin.
Now deal with a troll to the north and bring me its bones.
.

# Dialogue when on stage 2 (need bones) and player doesn't have it
dialogue_stage_2
Have you slain a troll yet?
Bring me its bones as proof. They're to the north.
.

# Dialogue when on stage 2 and player HAS bones
dialogue_turnin_2
Well done, adventurer! The area is much safer now.
I'll take those bones.
Here's 50 gold and a quest point for your service.
You've proven yourself a capable warrior.
.

# Dialogue after quest is complete
dialogue_complete
Thank you again for dealing with those pests.
The people of Lumbridge sleep safer because of you.
.
